     "In the event of a material breach of the OMV Code of Conduct, Company shall be entitled to terminate the Agreement with immediate effect and without the need for any other prior formality. Moreover, OMV Group Companies shall be entitled, in its sole reasonable discretion, to exclude Contractor from any further procurement activity in certain field of business or group-wide.",
